OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifter caught after bicycle
OL,4,Achase through city
OL,5,
OL,6,FBody-worn video footage has been
OL,7,Freleased showing a known shoplifter
OL,8,Fbeing chased through city streets by a
OL,9,Fpolice officer on a bike.
OL,11,FJames McMurray, aged 38, stole more
OL,12,Fthan #3,000 of goods from supermarkets
OL,13,Facross Southampton, Hampshire police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FHe subsequently pleaded guilty to 42
OL,17,Fcounts of shoplifting, as well as
OL,18,Fpossession of crack cocaine and heroin
OL,19,Fat Southampton Magistrates Court and
OL,20,Fwas jailed for a year.
